{'symbol': 'DVA', 'date': '2022-11-03 06:02:00', 'title': 'DAVITA CLINICAL RESEARCH SHOWCASES CHRONIC KIDNEY DISEASE AND RARE DISEASE NETWORK, PRESENTS NEW RESEARCH FINDINGS AT KIDNEY WEEK 2022', 'text': 'THIS YEAR\'S RESEARCH CENTERED ON ADVANCEMENTS IN KIDNEY TRANSPLANTATION AND EQUITY IN PATIENT CARE DAVITA ADDRESSES EQUITABLE ACCESS TO BREAKTHROUGH TRIALS AND DECENTRALIZED RESEARCH BY INTRODUCING NEW CHRONIC KIDNEY DISEASE & RARE DISEASE NETWORK DENVER , NOV. 3, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DAVITA CLINICAL RESEARCH (DCR) WILL HIGHLIGHT ITS LATEST RESEARCH DURING THE AMERICAN SOCIETY OF NEPHROLOGY (ASN) KIDNEY WEEK, BEING HELD IN ORLANDO FROM NOVEMBER 2-6, 2022. "WE LOOK FORWARD TO KIDNEY WEEK AS A CRUCIAL INFLECTION POINT TO SOCIALIZE NEW DISCOVERIES AND ADVANCEMENTS THAT ARE CHANGING THE LIVES OF PATIENTS," SAID DR.\xa0STEVEN BRUNELLI, VICE PRESIDENT OF HEALTH ECONOMICS AND OUTCOMES RESEARCH FOR DAVITA.'}